## Patch text - expect 200
PATCH http://localhost:3000/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "text": "An edited post that is still over thirty characters."
}

###
## Empty body, every field optional via PartialType - expect 200
PATCH http://localhost:3000/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###
## Changing the author (omitted from PatchPostDto) - expect 400
PATCH http://localhost:3000/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "authorId": 2
}

###
## text too short (@MinLength(30)) - expect 400
PATCH http://localhost:3000/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "text": "Too short"
}

###
## Unknown post id - expect 404
PATCH http://localhost:3000/posts/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "text": "An edited post that is still over thirty characters."
}

###
## Non-numeric id (ParseIntPipe) - expect 400
PATCH http://localhost:3000/posts/abc
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "text": "An edited post that is still over thirty characters."
}
